Z||000010||Smoooooth GT||06-10-2001||06:29 PM||||FieroGTguy....  Great point....  The thing's that we do to our car's make them one of a kind...  ALSO...  The Pride factor comes in...  Some of us are taking chances modifing our Fiero's to the point that they ARE one of a kind... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smooth1_1.JPG"> <BR>Just be PROUD of what ever you do to your car, THAT is what makes them unique...Steve<P>------------------<BR>aka..FieroSEt<BR>Fiero_87GT@yahoo.com<BR>cell.. 903 445 0849<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_6.JPG"> ||||reg||1
